# GetRobotPose
# 查询机器人当前位姿（默认 TF: map -> base_footprint）
# 由 amr_navigation 节点提供，供 amr_manager / 监控 / 云端桥接跨进程调用

# ===== Request =====
string frame_id    # 目标坐标系，默认 "base_footprint"

---
# ===== Response =====
bool success
float64 x
float64 y
float64 yaw
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
string message
